Remember, the CSS tip is that you can use custom properties to work out the nested radius of elements for you 😎
.panel {
--radius: 28px;
--padding: 8px;
--nested-radius: calc(var(--radius) - var(--padding);
}
.content {
border-radius: var(--nested-radius);
}
